{
  "date": "2026-10-08",
  "scope": "Equal console records and terminal dividers; contextual expense entry; visual Reports on projects and shared pool. Preserve Pullwise style. Web preview only.",
  "implementation": [
    "Shared natural CSS grid rows have equal outer heights; content remains centered, complete and selectable. Headers/helpers/pagers stay outside record grids; bounded scrolling is on outer wrappers.",
    "Remove decorative terminal borders, including parallel Reports and Billing trailing notes; retain following sections, stacked Reports, record and control boundaries.",
    "Remove expense target chooser. New records use their current page target; edits preserve original target/revision; Date focus, drafts, permission and idempotency guards remain.",
    "Shared responsive SVG date trend and category columns replace report rows; exact BigInt money, independent currencies, real calendar spacing and persistent mouse/touch/keyboard inspection.",
    "Only non-touch pointer movement drives hover inspection. Compatibility mouse-enter after touch cannot replace the tapped value."
  ],
